# norm-adapter-sdk governance

## required_directories

- `crates/`
- `docs/`
- `.github/`

## agent_rules

### update_order

1. Record a decision before changing the extraction boundary or public API.
2. Read `docs/decisions.md` and `docs/planning/status.md` before proposing
   scope changes.
3. Run the full gate set (`cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --workspace
   --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test --workspace`, `cargo doc
   --workspace --no-deps`) before reporting work complete.

### determinism

- Structured outputs are versioned and byte-deterministic; never truncate,
   reorder, or summarize to fit a size bound — fail instead.

### identity_parameterization

- Host variance enters only through `AdapterIdentity`. Any new host-specific
  string outside that struct is a scope violation requiring a decision
  record.

## readme_language_sync

- README.md is primary; README.zh-CN.md carries the same sections in
  Chinese and must be updated in the same commit.
